the Apple Wallet app. When configured, your app appears in Wallet’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"From Apps on Your iPhone","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" section."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sessions approach provides a high-level base class, "},{"code":"WalletExtensionHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", that handles the full extension flow. You subclass it and override a small set of methods.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites","level":3,"anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In-app provisioning must be working first.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.payment-pass-provisioning"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement must be present on the main app, Non-UI Extension, and UI Extension targets."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A shared keychain access group must be configured (the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychainAccessGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" you passed to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Configuration"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-1-Create-the-Non-UI-Extension-Target","text":"Step 1: Create the Non-UI Extension Target","level":3},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, go to ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"File > New > Target","type":"text"}]},{"text":" and select ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Action Extension","type":"text"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Remove all generated files except ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[